**Consolidation Strategy:**
Create common builder utilities in `org.openhab.core.ai.common.builder`:

```java
// Abstract builder base class
public abstract class AbstractBuilder<T> {
    protected final Map<String, Object> properties = new HashMap<>();
    
    protected abstract T buildInternal();
    
    public T build() {
        validate();
        return buildInternal();
    }
    
    protected void validate() {
        // Common validation logic
    }
    
    protected void setProperty(String key, Object value) {
        properties.put(key, value);
    }
    
    protected @Nullable Object getProperty(String key) {
        return properties.get(key);
    }
}

// Builder utilities
public final class BuilderUtils {
    public static <T> T buildWithValidation(AbstractBuilder<T> builder) {
        return builder.build();
    }
    
    public static void validateRequired(String name, @Nullable Object value) {
        if (value == null || (value instanceof String && ((String) value).isBlank())) {
            throw new IllegalArgumentException(name + " is required");
        }
    }
}
```

